{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "slug": "railway",
  "name": "Railway",
  "description": "检查服务和日志、部署应用，并在 Railway 容器中运行命令。",
  "categories": [
    "developer"
  ],
  "featured": false,
  "branding": {
    "logoUrl": "/brands/apps/railway.svg",
    "darkLogoUrl": "/brands/apps/railway-dark.svg"
  },
  "urlPatterns": [
    "https://mcp.railway.com/"
  ],
  "methods": [
    {
      "key": "mcp-oauth",
      "transport": "mcp_remote",
      "auth": "oauth",
      "ownershipModes": [
        "dcr",
        "customer"
      ],
      "whenToUse": "在浏览器中授权你的 Railway 账户。",
      "defaults": {
        "serverUrl": "https://mcp.railway.com",
        "scopesHint": [
          "openid",
          "offline_access",
          "workspace:member"
        ],
        "oauthAuthorizationParams": {
          "prompt": "consent"
        }
      },
      "guidanceMd": "登录 Railway，并选择智能体可使用的工作区。Railway 接受 API 访问连接后，Alice 会添加直接操作服务、部署和受限日志的工具。容器命令需要在连接中单独配置 SSH。Railway 托管连接不支持项目令牌。",
      "riskTier": "S4",
      "label": "连接 Railway",
      "consoleLinks": {
        "docs": "https://docs.railway.com/ai/mcp-server",
        "register": "https://docs.railway.com/integrations/oauth/creating-an-app",
        "settings": "https://railway.com/account"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "Railway 会强制限制在授权时选择的工作区。所选操作默认设为“允许”；对需要你批准的操作请选择“先询问”。",
        "日志和容器命令可能暴露应用数据及密钥。仅向可信且确实需要使用所选服务的智能体授予访问权限。",
        "通用 Railway 智能体和提交暂存更改功能不可用，因为 Alice 无法逐项审查其内部变更。",
        "Railway 在线资格验证仍待完成。如果 Railway 拒绝 API 访问，请使用所需权限重新连接；Alice 不会改用其他凭据。"
      ],
      "requiredResourceFilters": [
        "workspace",
        "project",
        "environment",
        "service"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "redirectConstraints": "https-or-loopback-http"
}
